commit 4013bfbf
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:51:43 -0600
subject: feat(messages): message-driven tool-building — facets, identity, annotations, actions, hooks, UI

M1: message_facets table (migration 003) + capture-time facet extraction;
    /api/messages facet filter params (latencyMin/Max, tokensMin/Max,
    costMin/Max, hasTools, hasThinking, truncated, clientTool, ide);
    facet counts via SQL GROUP BY for the filter sidebar
M2: jsonPath query param (SQLite JSON1, parameterized, whitelisted ops)
M3: identity as first-class dimension — clientDetector.js (Aider, Cline,
    Roo Code, Windsurf, Zed, Warp, OpenRouter SDK) + IDE detection;
    client_tool/ide captured in requestDetail + all 7 capture call sites
M4: message_annotations + saved_views tables (migration 004),
    annotationsRepo.js, /api/messages/[id]/annotations + /api/saved-views
M5: per-message actions (/api/messages/[id]/actions: replay, summarize,
    send-to-webhook, add-note, tag, alert-on-match) + /api/hooks with
    {{template}} expansion (JSON-aware, never sends raw Authorization)
M6: UI — TruncatedBadge (never-silent _truncated flag), FacetsSidebar
    (counts per dimension, click-to-filter), SavedViewsDropdown (save/
    apply/delete), ActionMenu (wired to M5) in list + detail drawer +
    Timeline/Board/Inbox/Trace views; getErrorSummary reports truncated

Tests: 64/64 pass (message-facets, annotations-repo, hook-template,
client-detector, request-details-json-filter, error-inbox)
Docs: message-driven-tools-plan.md, ADR-010, research note + tracking


